# Optional local config, sourced by the cron scripts. Copy to data/memory.env.
# Everything here is optional — absent means the feature degrades quietly.

# Where to surface alerts a human will actually read (an Obsidian INBOX note,
# a plain markdown file, anything append-able). Unset = alerts go to the cron
# log only; the memory system itself keeps working.
# CLAUDE_MEM_INBOX=/path/to/INBOX.md
